WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.740
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:06.540
When you watch Kaleido Star, I want you
to keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.510
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:12.980
Well, well, well.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:16.720
Everyone is waiting for me to be
the energetic me that I was before.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.550
Too many sad things happened,

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:21.120
and I closed my eyes and
stopped seeing anything,

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.590
and caused people nothing but worry.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:26.600
But nobody wants to see me crying, do they?

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.430
My smile... That's right! Smiles!

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:31.700
Not just mine, but everybody's!

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.140
I'll aim for a stage with no battles
and lots of smiles! I will! I will!

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:47.950
<i>Tattoo Kiss hajimari wa aka to kuro no Passion</i>

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:47.950
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the beginning is
red and black passions</i>

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:55.260
<i>Toki ni urahara na kokoro o tayori ni</i>

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:55.260
<i>Sometimes, we rely on our contrary hearts</i>

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.360
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.360
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:02.020
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:02.020
New Wings

00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:02.020
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:09.970
<i>Koi ni aimai na kotae wa iranai</i>

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:09.970
<i>There is no place for ambiguous answers in love</i>

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:17.450
<i>Arienai genjitsu minai furi shite mo Bet</i>

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:17.450
<i>Even while pretending not to see the
impossible reality, we bet</i>

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:23.710
<i>Egatai shinjitsu Can U feel me now?</i>

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:23.710
<i>Hard to obtain truth. Can you feel me now?</i>

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:28.260
<i>Nesshiyasui jibun ni Say What?</i>

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:28.260
<i>Say what to myself who gets excited easily?</i>

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:31.620
<i>Tomadou iibun</i>

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:31.620
<i>I'm confused, what to say</i>

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:40.840
<i>Dreamin' samenai yume ochiteku sadame</i>

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:40.840
<i>Dreamin' the never-waking dream,
the falling fate</i>

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:46.600
<i>Don't stop lovin' Can't stop lovin' U
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:46.600
<i>Don't stop lovin' can't stop lovin' you
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:55.950
<i>Believe in U hikikae ni subete ushinatte mo</i>

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:55.950
<i>I believe in you even if I lose everything for it</i>

00:01:55.950 --> 00:02:01.480
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' U
No no no</i>

00:01:55.950 --> 00:02:01.480
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' you
No no no</i>

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.090
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.090
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:24.810
Don't make me laugh!

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.480
What do mean, you don't want to battle?!

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:28.680
You're just running away from
the competition, that's all!

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.320
You coward!

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:38.390
You should think carefully about how
much your attitude just now hurt May.

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:42.120
There are times when you can hurt
someone by not fighting too.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:48.870
Maybe it's just like Miss Layla said.
Maybe I hurt May.

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:55.740
But even if that's true,
I still won't battle onstage anymore.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:03:00.480
My dream is to create the fun Kaleido Stage
that I saw when I was little.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.950
I won't ever lose sight of my dream again.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:08.060
Someday, with everyone working together,
we'll create it for sure.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:10.750
May and Mr. Leon, too...

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:13.900
Mr. Leon?

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:16.920
Sophie... I'm so glad...

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:21.500
I've never seen Mr. Leon's eyes look so kind.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:24.440
I wonder who "Sophie" is...

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:29.840
An Amazingly Humiliating Performance

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:29.840
"An Amazingly Humiliating Performance"

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:32.470
An Amazingly Humiliating Performance

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:34.880
Sophie...

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.450
Partner?

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:39.990
Nobody can be Leon's partner.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:41.850
Nobody but her.

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:45.130
She must be who that woman was talking about.

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:48.960
What does that mean, that she's the one
who could be Leon's partner?

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.990
Why did he call her name while
he was looking at Sora?

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.600
So she's the one after all...

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:56.810
Okay, break a leg everybody!

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:58.110
Thanks!

00:03:58.110 --> 00:03:59.470
Sorry to make you do this, Sora.

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:03.430
No, no, this is my job right now.
Ask me for anything.

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:09.950
The person who can become my partner
is Sora Naegino.

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:26.330
Um, Mr. Leon, today they're letting me
help scatter the flower petals.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:29.700
I'll scatter them really hard... no, that's weird...

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.470
I'll scatter with all I've got...
no, that's the same thing...

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:36.640
Anyway, let's make this a great show!
Okay, see you!

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:47.390
I won the World Festival and Sora withdrew.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:51.350
Right now I'm the top star, and Sora is a gofer.

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:55.160
Sora ran away from the
competition yesterday too.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:05:01.300
I've won the competitions, but Sora is
still always there in front of me.

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:05.700
Hey, Leon, who is Sophie?

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:11.280
Is this "Sophie" someone who could
become your partner?

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:16.990
I don't know how amazing she is, but
I've got confidence that I can surpass her!

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:20.390
I'll prove I can do everything that she can do!

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:22.990
I'm the one who can become your partner!

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:26.160
The world's acknowledged my skill.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:29.300
I'll beat Sora AND Sophie!

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.090
You can't.

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.130
Why not?!

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:35.440
If you don't know why not,

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:39.100
you won't even be able to beat Sora,
let alone Sophie.

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:57.590
You won't even be able to beat Sora,
let alone Sophie.

00:06:00.530 --> 00:06:02.790
What's wrong with me?

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:09.000
What's Sora got that I haven't got? What?

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:27.380
Adjust the timetable. Plus thirty seconds.

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:31.930
May's even worse than she was yesterday.

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:33.020
Yes.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:49.480
Um, Mr. Leon, today they're letting me
help scatter the flower petals.

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:57.250
What?

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:05.360
Whoa.

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.150
Come.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:08.660
Huh?

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.470
Wait...

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:19.540
Please stop this, Mr. Leon.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.780
Release all the trapezes.

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:23.240
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.780
I'm going back.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:37.960
Please let me go back.

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:39.090
No.

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:41.560
You've finally come onstage, haven't you Sora?

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.170
Let's finally settle things today!

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:46.600
Stop it.

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:48.930
Wait!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:57.230
The audience is unsettled. This is no good.

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:59.350
Right now, I have to perform.

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:01.540
So are you in the mood to do this now?

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.650
Is this part of the show?

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:05.380
It's kind of amazing.

00:08:05.890 --> 00:08:09.520
You won't even be able to beat Sora,
let alone Sophie.

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:12.190
I want to win... I want to win.

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:15.100
I want to win against Sora!

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:17.370
Hey, May's not looking half bad!

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:21.740
She's so passionate, it's like she's
trying to take Romeo's love by force!

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:23.930
I've never seen a Juliet like this!

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:27.940
And Sora's performance is so energetic
it's like May's ferocity can't even touch her!

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:31.940
She looks like she's enjoying being onstage!

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:40.340
I'll fall...

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:04.170
I can hear it... I can hear the audience's voice...

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:06.150
I'm so happy.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:10.350
That's the Angel's Maneuver
that I saw at the festival...

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:23.490
Leon's acting has changed!

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:25.460
Leon...

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:30.390
He's acting so kind. Is it an act?

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:32.340
Did I lose again?

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:35.980
Mr. Leon, I'm going back.

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:38.910
Please continue the show with May as Juliet.

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:44.780
Sophie.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:51.190
Please, wait!

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.560
Don't go!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:59.590
Mr. Leon!

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:02.300
This is bad!

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:32.000
They say Leon will need to be in the
hospital for two or three weeks.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:35.970
Although you could say his injuries are only
this minor because he's so lightweight.

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:39.130
So we're shutting ourselves down
for a month, huh?

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:40.980
I hope that's the worst of it.

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:46.810
Our saving grace is that Ken turned the lights off
so the audience didn't see the moment he hit.

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:49.380
Is the Kids Stage shut down too?

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:50.910
Looks like it.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:58.160
We showed the audience
a performance that wasn't fun.

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.500
It's not your fault, Sora.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:04.190
Even monkeys fall from trees.
Even Leon falls from trapezes.

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:08.940
Hurry, Sora! The air feels good.

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:10.060
Right.

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:13.310
You're right! It does feel good.

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:14.740
Told you.

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:17.710
May.

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:22.480
Things kind of got out of control, didn't they?

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:25.420
Did you visit Mr. Leon in the hospital?

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:30.650
I'm not going to go now. Because
I'm not Leon's partner yet.

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:34.330
Do you know who "Sophie" is?

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:36.300
No...

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:42.140
Sophie's probably the only person in the world
who can become Leon's partner.

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:45.630
And Leon's seeing you as Sophie.

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:48.980
You, and not me.

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:50.950
I wonder why...

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:55.920
I mean, my contract was terminated,
and I'm not even allowed onstage...

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:57.850
You probably remind him of her.

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:00.520
How dense you are, for instance.

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:03.620
You're so dense it's a crime.

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:10.990
You've beaten me this far into the ground,
and you haven't even noticed, have you?

00:12:11.470 --> 00:12:14.700
I'VE beaten YOU into the ground?

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:16.900
Are you sure you haven't got that backwards?

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:22.940
You're dense!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:24.450
Super dense!

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:25.910
Totally and completely dense!

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:29.320
Extra Special Dangerous Dense!

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:35.690
But I have to admit that you've got
something I haven't got.

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:38.420
I've decided to try being a little more humble.

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:41.460
I'll become demonically humble,

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:44.660
and then I'll surpass you for sure
and I'll scorn you!

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:46.200
See you later.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:48.240
See you...

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:50.260
What was humble about that?

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:04.450
The insurance procedures and various
related things are going smoothly.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.580
Okay.

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:07.950
Come in.

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:13.790
We've been waiting for you, Mr. Kenneth.

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:20.500
Shutting yourself down, eh?
Is this part of your plan, Kalos?

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.770
No.

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:23.470
Plan?

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:24.610
You, Boy.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:27.540
My name is Ken Robbins.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:30.280
How is Sora?

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:35.810
Sora thinks she's partly to blame for what
happened to Leon, so she's depressed.

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:39.950
Can't start running yet, eh?

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.320
No.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:45.730
Perhaps expecting them to become
partners was too much after all.

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:47.730
We don't know that yet.

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:51.530
What happened today might trigger something.

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.070
That's true.

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:56.670
I suppose I'll watch how things go
for a little longer.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:14:01.280
We'll see if Leon Oswald can
become Sora's partner.

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:05.050
Huh? They're questioning Leon and not Sora?

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:12.350
I believe that when that happens,
Kaleido Stage will grow along with Sora.

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:14.090
Please look forward to it.

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:18.050
What are they trying to make Sora do?

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:25.470
I wonder if Miss Layla and Miss Cathy
mean to go back to Broadway.

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:28.870
Yeah, the shows here got canceled, but, like,
they don't look like they're going back.

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:32.030
It's like, they're really into Kaleido Stage.

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:34.300
Is, like, someone here?

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.700
Sora's a real mystery, isn't she?

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:43.280
It's like she's getting her real sparkle back while
none of the people around her are noticing.

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:46.190
I might be one of those people.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:47.680
Oh really?

00:14:48.090 --> 00:14:51.790
I may have made a mistake.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:56.430
The totally sincere girl
who loves Kaleido Stage...

00:14:57.060 --> 00:15:00.660
She jumped into this all alone,
with aspirations in her heart.

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:05.270
I entrusted that Sora with my dream.

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:10.230
I wanted her to reach the faraway place
that I couldn't get to.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:18.750
I thought no matter how bitter and cruel
a path that was, Sora could succeed.

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:23.250
Because I don't think there's any
other path to becoming a real star.

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:29.790
But maybe I shouldn't have asked
for that kind of ruthlessness from Sora.

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:33.430
What do you think of May?

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:36.400
I'm the opposite: May's the one
who's got my sympathy.

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:37.660
May?

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:41.980
Yeah. May's got nowhere to go with her
feelings of idolization for you,

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:44.750
so she's taking everything out
on Leon and Sora.

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:48.420
Right now she needs someone to become
a goal for her and draw out her power,

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.420
but she doesn't have anyone.

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:56.660
If she needs a goal, her potential future self
should be the best goal.

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:58.860
That was always my goal.

00:15:58.860 --> 00:16:02.760
Not everyone is as strong as you are, you know.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:06.400
Miss Layla! You've got a guest!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.270
There's a guest here to see you, Miss!

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:18.510
Um... Miss Layla, the truth is I came
because want to ask you a favor.

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:24.690
You've retired from Kaleido Stage, so I don't
know if it's okay for me to ask this or not,

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:27.390
but I'd like you to train me!

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:31.930
I want to get hold of whatever it is
that Sora's got and I don't.

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:33.760
I want to change myself more!

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:37.160
So please!

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:41.300
Why not? We've got time, after all.

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:44.200
That's true. All right, then.

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:47.830
Thank you very much!

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:52.380
Sometimes it's nice to have
our tea out here, right?

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:56.380
Yeah. But it's so nice out,
shouldn't we ask Mia and Anna...

00:16:56.380 --> 00:17:00.790
It looks like everyone is busy doing things
since we got a sudden vacation.

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:02.320
Oh.

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:07.990
You were really energetic onstage yesterday.
Mia and the others were saying so too.

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:12.970
To tell you the truth, somewhere along
the way I started having fun.

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:14.490
I thought so.

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:19.970
I thought, "The backstage job is fun too,

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:24.380
but maybe the stage is really where I belong."

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:26.570
That's what I think too.

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:29.710
When I heard the audience's voice yesterday,

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:33.050
I was so happy I really cheered up.

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:36.820
I felt like I was getting strength
from the audience.

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:41.030
Hey, the thing you did yesterday
was the "Angel's Maneuver," right?

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:41.900
Yeah.

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:43.300
Is it hard?

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:45.100
Yeah, I guess so.

00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:46.570
Which part?

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:48.870
Huh? "Which part"?

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:50.940
Um, it's pretty much like,

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:52.940
when your power and your
partner's power go WAAAAH,

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:54.980
then all at once you jump up like SHOOM!,
but it kind of gets hmmmm,

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:58.680
and it's like there's no whoosh,
or I guess it's like YAAA! or ZOOM!,

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:00.210
so... do you basically get it?

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:01.310
Not at all.

